shedman-keybindings(1)

# NAME

shedman-keybindings - searchable dialog of every keybinding and gesture

# SYNOPSIS

*shedman keybindings*

# DESCRIPTION

Opens a GTK4 dialog listing every keyboard shortcut and touchpad
gesture on the desktop, grouped by category and filterable as you
type. Bound to *Super+Alt+K*. Entries come from the shipped metadata
plus a live *hyprctl* scan, so user-added binds appear under
*Other* with their raw command.

# SEE ALSO

*shedman-launcher*(1)
